NOTE ON SCOPE

This MIT license covers the scripts, documentation and build tooling in this
repository (build.sh, scripts/, docs/, README).

The patch files under patches/ modify Linux kernel source and are therefore
derived works of that source; they are distributed under GPL-2.0, matching the
kernel they patch.

The kernel source itself is NOT included in this repository. It is fetched at
build time from its upstream (Driftwood Kernel, itself derived from Xiaomi's
GPL-released sources). All copyrights remain with their respective owners.
